<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, OCT 18.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, OCT 18.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Oct 18	Oct 17	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  241.010     240.960     237.040    1.67 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  300.350     300.260     303.640   -1.08 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.300     156.490     165.490   -5.55 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.270	46.254	48.410   -4.42 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  382.500     380.580     366.280    4.43 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.325     139.470     147.886   -5.79 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.695	15.664	14.975    4.81 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  214.290     214.700     230.135   -6.89 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.858	 1.859	 1.939   -4.18 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.553	 1.551	 1.575   -1.40 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.995     190.000     206.030   -7.78 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
